The map-update hook is concrete but implemented behind private generated helper names, so ordinary `unfold` cannot name its internals. I’m exposing only those private map-model definitions through a small proof-time delta tactic, then proving the concrete update by simplification; this does not add any theorem, axiom, or semantic shortcut.
